      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There's seemingly NO REASON to NOT have VRChat on MacOS! I use windows, but am unable to play VRChat with a good friend of mine just because they have a mac. Apple products are dumb as hell, but I wanna be able to play with my friends, regardless of whether its a mac or not. Atleast give us, the community, a CLEAR REASON as to why there is no MacOS support!",
