      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5d3e5509535bf31beadcffcc|full_name}: They will tell you two big things, sadly:\n1. Maintenance of another build. This means more testing, etc.\n2. Shaders - Shaders need to be compiled for every platform VRChat targets. Currently, no shaders are being compiled to target Metal/OpenGL on macOS.\n\nI would like VRChat on macOS myself. This is not intended to be a downer or proof it's not doable. It's very doable. It's a matter of will and resources being put behind it. - I think we will get there someday.",
      "viewerReactions": null
