      "value": "Nowadays Mac standard Mac hardware are pretty good for VR. It was surprise for me, but my MacBook Pro 16 works just perfect in VR. And it works on heights possible graphic settings in non optimise Windows. So I only can imagine how it could work on MacOS Metal =3\nYeah, for now Mac users are ready for VR and all hardware from resent years will be pretty compatible with VR.",
