      "value": "@{6010f88db2d2d8488dfd3731|full_name}: shader support is a hurdle to overcome to add another platform of any sort.\nIt would be a bummer to have a Mac/Linux/PS5 client, but have the “this was not uploaded for Quest” issue 100x more.",
